<item><title>Togo assigns road company maintenance target of 1 700 km for 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-assigns-road-company-maintenance-target-of-1-700-km-8471c2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-assigns-road-company-maintenance-target-of-1-700-km-8471c2/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The target is in the 2027-2029 programme budget, while the government has not specified the cost of the work.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:01:39 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo&apos;s lawmakers approve creation of deposits fund in first reading</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-lawmakers-approve-creation-of-deposits-fund-in-first-b54146/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-lawmakers-approve-creation-of-deposits-fund-in-first-b54146/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The proposed institution would manage public and private deposits and invest them in projects including housing, health, education, water and renewable energy.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:45:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-lawmakers-approve-creation-of-deposits-fund-in-first-b54146/share.jpg" length="42949" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-lawmakers-approve-creation-of-deposits-fund-in-first-b54146/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo begins 16-day campaign against violence toward women and girls</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-begins-16-day-campaign-against-violence-toward-women-219e9b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-begins-16-day-campaign-against-violence-toward-women-219e9b/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The guidance covers physical, psychological, sexual, economic and online abuse, and sets out ways victims and witnesses can seek help.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:42:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo closes mosque and extends church suspension over noise complaints</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-closes-mosque-and-extends-church-suspension-over-noise-459a10/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-closes-mosque-and-extends-church-suspension-over-noise-459a10/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The government says the measures enforce limits of 70 decibels by day and 55 at night under a 2025 order.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:42:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-closes-mosque-and-extends-church-suspension-over-noise-459a10/share.jpg" length="44607" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-closes-mosque-and-extends-church-suspension-over-noise-459a10/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
